  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 12800000, guid: 8e54e8e1613e5f84e849f4fb919026c1, type: 3}
    m_FontSize: 125
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 0
    m_MaxSize: 150
    m_Alignment: 4
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "End Credits\n\nMeet the Creators!\n\n\n\n\nExecutive Team\nSupreme Overlord
    of All Things: Keegan Ohlman\n\nSupreme Overlord\u2019s Assistant Who Totally
    Works Just as Hard: Ashley Berna\n\nGuy Who Stares at Screens Until the Code
    Works: Jacob Daniel\n\nThe Voice That Haunts Your Dreams: Mr. Luyk\n\nEmotional
    Support and Vibe Curator: Mr. Martinez\n\nProgramming & Development\n\u201CThis
    Should Work\u201D Engineer: Jacob Daniel\n\n\u201CWhy is Nothing Working\u201D
    Engineer: Ashley Berna\n\nMultiplayer Wizard & Documentation Sorcerer: Keegan
    Ohlman\n\nArt & Design\n2D? 3D? Who Knows? Let\u2019s Just Draw: Ashley Berna\n\nUI
    Architect of Chaos: Jacob Daniel\n\nSound & Voice\nThe Only Recognizable Human
    Voice in This Game: Mr. Luyk\n\nQuality Assurance & Testing\nKeegan Ohlman (Tests
    it once and calls it good)\n\nAshley Berna (Breaks it immediately)\n\nJacob Daniel
    (Tries to fix what Ashley broke, breaks it worse)\n\nSpecial Thanks\nMr. Martinez
    (For being emotionally available in our time of need)\n\nCaffeine (For keeping
    us alive)\n\nKeegan\u2019s Documentation (It exists, and that\u2019s enough)\n\nThat
    One Line of Code That Magically Fixed Everything (We\u2019ll never understand
    you)\n\nThe Undo Button (Our most-used tool)\n\nStack Overflow (Without you,
    we'd be lost)\n\nOur Computers (For not catching fire\u2026 yet)\n\nThe Concept
    of Sleep (We\u2019ll try it someday)\n\nRandom Sound Effects That Make No Sense
    (Because why not)\n\nThat One Bug We Pretended Was a Feature\n\nSuper Ultra Special
    Thanks\nYou, the player, for making it to the end of this absurdly long credit
    sequence. Seriously, why are you still reading this? Go play the game.\n\nUltra
    Omega Platinum Tier Thanks\nThis text box (For existing)\n\nThe Scroll Bar (For
    letting us write this much nonsense)\n\nThe Color Black (Background MVP)\n\nAir
    (For allowing us to breathe while making this game)\n\nAnd finally...\n\nThis
    game is dedicated to all the Guy Bads out there. May your secrets remain hidden,
    your lies be believable, and your deception skills never fail you.\n\nThe End\u2026
    or is it?\n\n(\u2026It is.)\n\n"
